      "font size" : 11.0,
      "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
      "content" : "(f) Meals for special diets The Catering Department takes all dietary requirements seriously. If you have unique dietary requirements we suggest that you get in touch with the Head of Catering at catering@trin.cam.ac.uk.",
