    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Kitchen Fixed Charge opt-out: students who are granted an exceptional dispensation may take the occasional special meal in Hall, but will be charged at a higher (graduate) level."
